OL,5,G1500 Music Matters: Music on the Front
OL,6,G     Line
OL,7,     FClive Myrie is in conversation
OL,8,     Fwith fellow journalists. He and
OL,9,     FSteve share stories to reveal the
OL,10,     Fpower and significance of music
OL,11,     Fwhen reporting from extreme
OL,12,     Fconflict situations.
OL,13,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,14,     FAlyn Shipton celebrates midsummer
OL,15,     Fon the longest day of 2026.
OL,16,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,17,     FHannah French visits Paris to chat
OL,18,     Fto the harpsichordist, conductor
OL,19,     Fand founder of Les Talens Lyriques
OL,20,     Fabout his extraordinary career
OL,21,     Fwhich spans more than 4 decades.
